WEBVTT

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.830
<v><b>Louisa:</b></v> Hi! I'm Louisa.

00:00:19.373 --> 00:00:20.386
I’m in New York.

00:00:20.966 --> 00:00:25.189
I’m from England, but I’m here to learn about the life of a tour guide.

00:00:28.722 --> 00:00:32.130
Peter Greenwald is a New York tour guide.

00:00:33.238 --> 00:00:36.799
He lives in a small apartment in Brooklyn.

00:00:38.392 --> 00:00:40.866
He usually gets up at eight o’clock.

00:00:42.913 --> 00:00:45.513
Peter has a big breakfast.

00:00:46.981 --> 00:00:49.918
He usually has fruit and cereal,

00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:53.290
and sometimes he has an omelette.

00:00:56.127 --> 00:00:59.553
He leaves the house at nine o’clock.

00:01:00.683 --> 00:01:05.535
Peter works for a company called Real New York Tours.

00:01:07.743 --> 00:01:11.698
His tours always begin in Times Square.

00:01:12.726 --> 00:01:15.552
Every morning, he goes there by subway.

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:31.532
Peter usually arrives at about nine forty-five.

00:01:39.728 --> 00:01:42.730
He meets his group and tells them about the tour.

00:01:43.184 --> 00:01:45.804
At ten o’clock, the tour begins.

00:01:51.218 --> 00:01:55.612
Peter takes them to places of interest all around Manhattan.

00:02:29.117 --> 00:02:31.590
They have lunch in Greenwich Village.

00:02:32.792 --> 00:02:36.680
Peter usually has a real New York pizza.

00:02:53.219 --> 00:02:55.947
The tour ends in Wall Street.

00:03:12.198 --> 00:03:16.557
After work, Peter takes the subway back to Brooklyn.

00:03:17.752 --> 00:03:19.308
Then he relaxes.

00:03:20.295 --> 00:03:22.029
He usually reads a book.

00:03:22.925 --> 00:03:25.271
Sometimes, he watches TV.

00:03:26.178 --> 00:03:29.208
He goes to bed at about eleven o’clock.

00:03:30.446 --> 00:03:32.221
He needs to sleep.

00:03:32.854 --> 00:03:36.920
Every day he walks about six miles!

00:03:38.185 --> 00:03:40.635
Peter is an excellent tour guide;

00:03:41.029 --> 00:03:44.195
he loves his job, and he loves New York.